      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just really scared of the hospital and the cost... it honestly doesn't look that deep, it's just one arm. if i just take a really high dose of ibuprofen—like like like 1000mg or even more—and keep the ointment on, can't i just manage this myself for a few days and see if it gets better? i'm sure it's fine as long as i keep it clean.",
